{"title":"Chronicles Of The Lazy Sovereign","synopsis":"Dari penulis yang sama, Return of the Mount Hua Sect!\n\nSang pendekar agung yang mengakhiri kekacauan yang melanda dunia, dialah Wi Yeonho, Sang Kaisar Bela Diri yang Cemerlang.\n\nIa dikenal sebagai seorang pria terhormat, sosok agung, dan pendekar ksatria...\n\n“Orang itu? Dia bajingan sejati.”\n\nKebenaran mengejutkan yang terlalu memalukan untuk diungkap ke dunia, tentang sosok yang disebut-sebut sebagai pendekar paling ksatria dalam sejarah, akhirnya terungkap!","alternative_title":"태존비록, Kisah Bangsawan Pemalas","author":"Menyusul","artist":"Menyusul","genres":["Action","Adventure","Martial Arts","Murim"],"chapters":[{"id":"49e6ac65-e764-4efa-8443-d3ba57c95d25","number":"58","title":"Chapter 58","date":"2026-08-02","images":[]},{"id":"d48cf0c0-618c-4bbe-b6d8-0ad885a834c7","number":"57","title":"Chapter 57","date":"2026-07-25","images":[]},{"id":"03edc524-bb1b-41de-a9fe-f198e9f252fa","number":"56","title":"Chapter 56","date":"2026-07-18","images":[]},{"id":"bd734961-9e9e-45c1-841c-c71140813798","number":"55","title":"Chapter 55","date":"2026-07-12","images":[]},{"id":"088f03ee-54d2-4106-a8cb-f80ae2f5306c","number":"54","title":"Chapter 54","date":"2026-07-04","images":[]},{"id":"aefa355c-bd86-4050-b704-f46a058fa13f","number":"53","title":"Chapter 53","date":"2026-06-28","images":[]},{"id":"507da403-a5c8-47e5-a488-e01dc20bda08","number":"52","title":"Chapter 52","date":"2026-06-21","images":[]},{"id":"b2cb917e-6bf2-48de-a5f1-2f2e06c2da52","number":"51","title":"Chapter 51","date":"2026-06-14","images":[]},{"id":"742f0ddf-d474-4f21-a0c0-f64d09251c95","number":"50","title":"Chapter 50","date":"2026-05-31","images":[]},{"id":"0aab6cba-d8a5-4ba7-a6dc-6055198369a3","number":"49","title":"Chapter 49","date":"2026-05-23","images":[]},{"id":"5696b5bf-ea9d-45dc-821b-d919e7bc7c1c","number":"48","title":"Chapter 48","date":"2026-05-16","images":[]},{"id":"086ad5a7-b256-4bc8-96d0-b1ad5a4d796f","number":"47","title":"C